  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="573a9824-3f0d-5f06-8739-7550c0eea852" activityNameId="1d96aed2-a3dd-5908-8bb2-fbcde08f9faf" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silicon, solar grade, modified Siemens process, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silicon, solar grade, modified Siemens process, at plant
Electricity and heat demand updated for 2018. The remaining production efforts remain unchanged because recent data were not available.;
CAS number: 7440-21-3; 
Formula: Si; 
Synonyms: SoG-Silicon, polycrystaline; 
UUID: f7524bec-af49-37d8-bf90-4b2192fe888d
Gate to gate inventory for the production of high purity polycrystalline silicon from MG-silicon in actual processes. Only energy use, chemicals and yield are known. Emissions to water are roughly estimated.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production with Siemens process either from SiHCl3 or SiH4. Mix of electricity supply in accordance with actual conditions at considered production locations.
Time period: Time of investigation
Production volume: Approximately 450000 t in 2018
Sampling: Average of data from one company and estimated data from another company based on literature data 
Extrapolations: Emissions to water are estimated with figures investigated for MG-silicon purification to EG-silicon with a similar type of process.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f7524bec-af49-37d8-bf90-4b2192fe888d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="9aaa4753-f7ef-5e0d-bcb0-bc5f01164c5b" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
